  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the rustic charm of the countryside with our Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set. Featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics, this quilt set adds a cozy, timeless touch to any bedroom, making it a perfect gift for loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Farmhouse Design:</strong> Enjoy the classic patterns and soft, natural aesthetics that bring a cozy, timeless look to your bedroom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt set by selecting from various sizes, adding optional pillowcases, or including a name for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available in Multiple Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68''x86''), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), or King (102''x91'') to perfectly fit your bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift Idea:</strong> An excellent gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This microfiber quilt set is machine washable in cold water and can be air dried without heat for simple maintenance and lasting fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes one quilt, with the option to add two pillowcases for a complete look.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68''x86''), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), King (102''x91'')</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
